          "header": "Crafting",
          "template": "modopedia:page/headered_text",
          "text": "This mod adds 4 additional blocks that are used to craft various items.\nEvery crafting process requires a certain amount of $(c:blue)RP$(). Recipes that you haven't unlocked yet will require more $(c:blue)RP$() than those you have.You will not be able to craft an item if the required $(c:blue)RP$() is higher than your total $(c:blue)RP$()."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "modopedia:text",
          "text": "To unlock recipe you need to eat recipe breads. You can also just try experimenting as crafting a locked recipe will unlock it.\n"
        },
        {
