          "type": "modopedia:text",
          "text": "Weapon and tools can be upgraded in the forge while armor can be upgraded in the accessory workbench.\nOpen the upgrade gui by shift right clicking on the crafting device. An item can be upgraded a maximum of $(c:red)9$() times. Holding shift while hovering over an item will tell you what stat it gives. Using the same item multiple times causes a $(c:red)diminishing$() returns effect so try use different items!"
        }
